{"case_id":"T8041","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["API protocol","entry point reachability"],"commit_induced":"YES","maintenance_needed":true,"confidence":100,"affected_functions":["SolidityCompilationFramework::compileContract","SolidityCompilationFramework::methodIdentifiers","CompilerStack::methodIdentifiers","CompilerStack::contractIdentifiers","EvmoneUtility::compileDeployAndExecute"],"reason":"S1 removes the public CompilerStack::methodIdentifiers API and replaces it with CompilerStack::contractIdentifiers, but H0 still calls m_compiler.methodIdentifiers(_contractName). H0 therefore cannot compile against S1 and cannot reach the compiler/deploy/execute path. This incompatibility did not exist with S0, so the commit directly introduced the material harness gap.","evidence":["In H0, SolidityCompilationFramework::compileContract executes `m_compiler.methodIdentifiers(contractName)` to populate `CompilerOutput::methodIdentifiersInContract`.","In H0, SolidityCompilationFramework::methodIdentifiers also returns `m_compiler.methodIdentifiers(_contractName)`.","S1 deletes the `CompilerStack::methodIdentifiers` declaration and introduces `CompilerStack::contractIdentifiers` instead.","S1 changes production callers in StandardCompiler::compileSolidity and CommandLineInterface to extract `contractIdentifiers(contractName)[\"methods\"]`, while H0 retains the removed call."],"recommended_action":"Update both H0 calls to use `m_compiler.contractIdentifiers(contractName)[\"methods\"]`, preserving the flat method-identifier object expected by `CompilerOutput::methodIdentifiersInContract` and `EvmoneUtility::compileDeployAndExecute`."}
